00:15:20.569 --> 00:15:33.358
<v Daniel X. O'Neil>You know, peace and justice. And then they could have their own separate. So you could have this whole hierarchy of content under one TypePad account. Fifteen bucks. Fifteen bucks. Mind-blowing.

