<v Daniel X. O'Neil>So Adrian came up with ChicagoCrime. org, which was just a singular, mind-blowing thing because he reverse engineered the Google Maps before there was even an API. And, yeah, he would be able to show where crimes were happening. He was able to put dots on that.

