00:19:01.614 --> 00:19:20.929
<v Daniel X. O'Neil>But through that I met Adrian. And then when Adrian got the grant to start EveryBlock. com, which is local news and community website, I joined him and a couple others as co-founder. He was the founder and we had some other co-founders and got into open data and the civic data world that way.

