00:19:42.948 --> 00:20:22.305
<v Daniel X. O'Neil>So in my role at EveryBlock, I was responsible for getting civic data from 16 cities. So cold calling Mayor Michael Bloomberg in New York and asking him, you know, "Hey, can I talk to the mayor? " You'll be stunned to hear that he was in a meeting every time I call him. Oh yeah, he was in a meeting here. So I ended up just talking to people about, you know, our project, which we wanted, you know, like every building permit, every restaurant inspection, every crime report. And they'd end up sending me to whatever goofball in the mayor's office or department was interested in stuff like that.

00:20:22.305 --> 00:20:22.635
